		font-size: 26rpx;
		color: #595959;
		margin-right: 12rpx;
	}

	.btn-group {
		flex-direction: row;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		flex: 1;
	}

	.mini-btn {
		margin-right: 12rpx;
